                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        No. Modern local micro-anesthesia completely numbs the tooth. By utilizing computerized apex locators and high-torque rotary files, the entire canal is disinfected and sealed in ~45 minutes without the discomfort of multi-visit dressings.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 3 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">How long do Dental Implants last?</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Dental implants are biocompatible titanium fixtures that fuse permanently with the jawbone. With regular oral hygiene and routine checkups, implants can last a lifetime, preventing bone resorption without altering neighboring natural teeth.
                    </p>
                </div>

