                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">What sterilization standards are followed?</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        We adhere to a hospital-grade 6-step sterilization protocol featuring Class-B vacuum autoclaving. All instruments are sealed in individual sterile barrier pouches and unsealed exclusively in front of each patient.
